| **2** | **Mixed concerns — utility functions + threaded class demo jammed together** | 🟡 **Medium** | Whole file                                    |
| **3** | **`for u in users:` — single-letter loop variable**                          | 🟡 **Medium** | Line 12                                       |
| **4** | **`Counter` class has no class-level docstring**                             | 🟢 **Low**    | Line 19                                       |
| **5** | **`worker()` has no docstring**                                              | 🟢 **Low**    | Line 29                                       |
| **6** | **One-liner `for` bodies on the same line as the `for`**                     | 🟢 **Low**    | Lines 33–34                                   |
| **7** | **No blank line between class definition and the global code that follows**  | 🟢 **Low**    | After line 27                                 |
